tidalt (4.0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix silent playback on fixed-format USB audio interfaces (e.g. Focusrite
    Vocaster) by falling back to plughw: when format negotiation is refused.
  * Fix a crash and playback-loop overlap when reacquiring the ALSA device
    fails, and stop play/pause inverting after a failed resume.

